{
  "title": "Matemágico lanza: el círculo y lo que sale de él",
  "description": "docs/animas/matemagico/README.md § Casting. He no longer runs up and punches: he raises a hand, one of the zeros circling him flies to his fingertip and opens there into a circle of evenly spaced ticks, spinning down (a new zero comes out in the ring as the spell leaves), and whatever the spell throws leaves its middle. Atacar and Ángulo exacto, a ball of particles with 0, 1, e and π floating round it, in the colour of the element with its touch. Foc Binari, its two streams. Cardioide, its comet. Then a real Atacar with no element bought, at 35 and as a boy in chapter 1. Run it with --gpu --scale 2.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "open": "/?story=got-wrapper&solo=1&fight=%7B%22adult%22%3Atrue%2C%22partner%22%3Atrue%2C%22wear%22%3A%7B%22gerard%22%3A%22matemagico%22%2C%22aitor%22%3A%22papagato%22%7D%2C%22animas%22%3A%5B%22matemagico%22%2C%22papagato%22%2C%22tecnopata%22%5D%2C%22friends%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22encounter%22%3A%22dogs%22%2C%22foes%22%3A2%2C%22free%22%3Atrue%2C%22immune%22%3Atrue%2C%22improved%22%3A%5B%22matemagico%3Aagua%22%2C%22matemagico%3Afuego%22%2C%22matemagico%3Aelectrico%22%5D%7D"
    },
    {
      "eval": "navigator.getGamepads = () => []"
